 <h3><a href="../../plugins/pipeline-core/lib/critic-verify-lifecycle.mjs">plugins/pipeline-core/lib/critic-verify-lifecycle.mjs ↗</a></h3>
 <p>On readback, rederives the lifecycle identity and independently checks its Critic fields against the consumed private packet and its Verify fields against exact passing candidate evidence. The v2 carry-forward receipt also rederives its reviewed-to-target Git range and manifest binding, so a shaped private receipt or later edit cannot turn an unbound diagnostic Verify into a reviewed qualification.</p>
