 <h3><a href="../../plugins/pipeline-core/scripts/design-advisory-admission.mjs">plugins/pipeline-core/scripts/design-advisory-admission.mjs ↗</a></h3>
 <p>Its read-only inspect rechecks the current exact human decision for a stored Advisor-unavailable exception, then binds the same public bytes to the immutable private transaction and source receipt. An earlier write-time approval claim alone cannot make later inspection pass. For an answered Claude consult fallback, the admission retains `nativeAvailable: true` when the native route was tried and failed; it does not misclassify the successful adapter as native. A v2 private transaction also binds the host-observed native-then-consult attempt trail byte-for-byte. That local trail is not provider attestation or a final PO approval, and the unavailable pre-approval package path remains open.</p>
