 <h3><a href="../../plugins/pipeline-core/lib/model-role-route-source.mjs">plugins/pipeline-core/lib/model-role-route-source.mjs ↗</a></h3>
 <p>Explicit PO task-to-role projection against the committed V3 route cells, including the newly registered pure-read duty. It rejects a missing, extra or conflicting route instead of silently omitting it; a runner-scoped view feeds bootstrap while the complete source stays bound by policy. Selector names never infer roles.</p>
