 <h3><a href="../../plugins/pipeline-core/lib/agy-host-commit-admission.mjs">plugins/pipeline-core/lib/agy-host-commit-admission.mjs ↗</a></h3>
 <p>Captures a clean Git baseline before Agy runs and admits only a host-observed diff that exactly matches the validated final return and consent paths, including the clean-filtered Git blob IDs at admission; it does not stage or commit. Before a completed-undelivered record, its physical-root Git observation refuses a changed or unreadable HEAD instead of declaring no commit.</p>
